* Physical AI - Experiment 17 architecture A: feedback resistor TIA
* Inverting TIA. Vout = I * Rf * A/(A+1). Summing node held by the amplifier, not by a 0 V source. Rf = 1/G_WEIGHT.
* Frozen Experiment 9 network A. Weights were not edited.
* Behavioral circuit analysis. Not transistor-level or PCB power.
* A_tia=100000 A_inv=1e+07 rail=15 vos=0 rout=0 Ileak=0 clip=False linear=False
* shape: 2 -> 4 -> 1

* Experiment 24 candidate L
* XSPICE limit TIA (programmable Vos)
* source: ngspice built-in analog code model `limit`
* Behavioral. Used as AZ/servo/chopper carrier and feasibility map.
* Weights were not edited. SPICE is not Python-corrected.
.model limtia limit(gain=100000 in_offset=0.0 out_lower_limit=-15 out_upper_limit=15 fraction=false limit_range=0.05)

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
* passive invert in1 -> in1n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv1ia in1 inv1m 10000
Rinv1ib in1n inv1m 10000.0020000002
Einv1amp in1n 0 0 inv1m 10000000
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
* passive invert in2 -> in2n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv2ia in2 inv2m 10000
Rinv2ib in2n inv2m 10000.0020000002
Einv2amp in2n 0 0 inv2m 10000000
Vref vref 0 DC 1
* passive invert vref -> vrefn: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinvrefia vref invrefm 10000
Rinvrefib vrefn invrefm 10000.0020000002
Einvrefamp vrefn 0 0 invrefm 10000000
* load-compensated divider vref->tapref: G_load=0.00135041774642313 Ra=425030.827613635 Rb=1000 target beta=0.001 (no tap buffer)
Rdivrefa vref tapref 425030.827613635
Rdivrefb tapref 0 1000
* load-compensated divider vrefn->taprefn: G_load=0.000833646933955897 Ra=544815.897488381 Rb=1000 target beta=0.001 (no tap buffer)
Rdivrefna vrefn taprefn 544815.897488381
Rdivrefnb taprefn 0 1000

